# NOT excluding test/ — tsconfig.json has no explicit rootDir/outDir, so
# TypeScript infers rootDir from every included .ts file it can see,
# test/ included (confirmed: this is why `nest build` already emits
# dist/src/main.js rather than dist/main.js — the inferred rootDir is the
# project root, anchored partly by test/ and prisma.config.ts sitting
# alongside src/). Excluding test/ from this build context risks silently
# changing that inference and breaking the exact path main.ts's CMD below
# depends on. TECH_DEBT #45 already flags setting an explicit rootDir/
# outDir as the proper fix, "alongside the first Dockerfile" — deliberately
# NOT taking that side-quest here; keeping test/ present is the zero-risk
# choice that doesn't require touching tsconfig at all.
